    life_chapters: "Life often unfolds around work, craft, service, health. Many Virgo rising have a defining relationship with their body or their daily routine \u2014 illness, recovery, dietary discoveries, exercise as medicine. Career chapters tend to refine over time toward mastery of one specific thing.",
