    life_chapters: 'Life often unfolds around partnership in some form \u2014 romantic, business, creative collaborations, marriages and divorces and remarriages. Many Libra rising have a defining "we" chapter that shapes the whole trajectory. Aesthetic and creative work threads through every era.',
