    social_mask: "Reserved, perceptive, magnetic. Strangers read them as enigmatic \u2014 and they are, on purpose. Reveals slowly, by careful choice. Listens twice as much as they speak in the first conversation, watching for who you actually are when you don't know you're being read.",
