    when_to_use: 'The career-path spread is for moments when work is at a fork: a job offer, a pivot, a launch, a leaving, a return after a break, a creative project that wants to become a career. It works for anyone whose relationship to work is in motion \u2014 employees, founders, freelancers, artists, parents returning, students choosing. Pull it when the question is concrete enough to act on within three months. It is not for "what is my purpose in life?" (too open \u2014 use the Celtic Cross or a soul-purpose spread). It is for "should I take this offer?", "is this side project worth committing to?", "should I leave this role?". The five cards are designed to translate vague work-anxiety into a clear next step.',
