    in_love: "For relationship-work overlap (a partner whose career affects yours, a co-founder relationship, a partner asking you to choose between them and the work) \u2014 the career spread will honor the work side cleanly, but pair it with a love spread to honor the relationship side. Reading both at once tells you whether the two are actually opposed or whether you have been told they are.",
    in_work: 'This is the work spread, so the work frame is built in. The most useful adaptation: pull it not on a single decision but on a *season*. "What does this next chapter of my work want?" \u2014 the spread will name where the chapter is ripe (Card 1), what it needs from you (Card 2), what is in the way (Card 3), and the first concrete move (Card 4). It is the strongest one-page strategic plan most professionals will ever generate.',
