    reversed: 'Reversed, the Queen of Wands can swing to two shadows. One is jealousy and competitive cattiness \u2014 the "queen bee" who guards her position by undermining other rising women (or men) in her sphere. The other is dimming \u2014 the woman who has been told for so long she is "too much" that she has agreed to take up half the room she was made for. The cure for the first is generosity; the cure for the second is permission. The world does not need fewer Queens. The world needs every Queen at full brightness.',
