    in_work: "In work, the Knight of Pentacles is the long-horizon project \u2014 the business that takes a decade to build, the practice that compounds, the manuscript written one chapter a month. Don't rush it. The slow build is the build. Career under this Knight rewards patience and punishes shortcut-seeking.",
