    display: "Life Path 3",
    archetype: "The Communicator",
    symbol: "\u{1F3AD}",
    ruling_planet: "Jupiter",
    element: "air",
    one_liner: "Expressive, creative, here to delight the world into remembering itself.",
    essence: 'Life Path 3 is the number of expression \u2014 the artist, the writer, the storyteller, the one who lights up a room without trying. 3s carry a buoyant, almost solar quality. They live for connection, conversation, color, and the moment when something funny or beautiful arrives unexpectedly. The deep call of the 3 is creative voice \u2014 not "being creative" as a hobby, but actually shaping the world through what they say, write, sing, draw, or perform. The shadow is scattered energy and the lifetime habit of starting many things and finishing few. The work is to let depth catch up with sparkle.',
