    pair_with_chakra: "Heart chakra \u2014 the chakra of caring enough to do the small extra thing.",
    pair_with_chakra_slug: "heart",
    pair_with_sound: "Letting Go meditation \u2014 to release the perfectionism that masquerades as standards.",
