    the_shadow: "The shadow of Uruz is brute force \u2014 strength used against, not for. Bullying, intimidation, the man who confuses muscle for masculinity. Or its inverse: collapse, the surrender of strength to avoid responsibility for using it.",
    pair_with_chakra: "Sacral chakra \u2014 Uruz lives in the hips, the womb, the pelvis; vital force is sacred.",
