    in_love: "A relationship that has weathered doubt \u2014 the partners can each call the earth to witness what they have built together, and the earth answers by trembling its agreement. Reversed: a partnership where one partner is still asking the external world to validate the love, rather than letting the earth (the felt-sense of what is true) witness for itself.",
