    slug: "warrior-one",
    text: "Warrior One",
    translation: "Virabhadrasana I. Virabhadra = the fierce warrior born from the rage-lock of Shiva's grief. The pose of the warrior arrived at the threshold.",
    tradition: "Hatha Yoga \u2014 named after the mythological warrior Virabhadra (Shiva Purana); central to Iyengar and Ashtanga lineages as the foundational warrior pose",
