      "What would change if I took 15 minutes of legs-up-the-wall daily for two weeks \u2014 what would my sleep, my swelling, my mood tell me?",
      "In a day that has demanded I be upright, doing, moving, producing \u2014 what part of me has been waiting all day to be inverted?"
