      <p><strong>This is the frame.</strong> Every body-practice on gab44 \u2014 <a href="/gab44/asanas">asanas</a>, <a href="/gab44/pranayama">pranayamas</a>, <a href="/gab44/mudras">mudras</a>, <a href="/gab44/mantras">mantras</a>, <a href="/gab44/chakras">chakras</a> \u2014 lives inside one of these eight limbs. Read the limbs to see where each practice belongs in the path, and what comes before and after.</p>
