    slug: "chokmah",
    text: "Chokmah",
    hebrew: "\u05D7\u05DB\u05DE\u05D4",
    translation: "Wisdom \u2014 pure dynamic force, the flash of insight before form arrives.",
    tradition: "Kabbalistic \u2014 the Father (Abba) of the supernal triad in the Zohar and Lurianic Kabbalah",
