    <p><strong>How to use this funnel.</strong> Read the Olympian your life is currently asking about \u2014 the one whose function is loudest in your present chapter. Each page pairs with a zodiac sign (already on gab44) and a planet (already on gab44), turning every god into a 3-funnel cross-link node.</p>
