    pair_with_planet: "Jupiter \u2014 the planet of the archer, the philosophical-tracker, the long-aim-at-the-distant-target; Oshosi is the orisha-Jupiter in the *hunter* register (distinct from Shang\xF3's Jupiter-as-king).",
    pair_with_planet_slug: "jupiter",
    pair_with_chakra: "Third eye \u2014 the seat of focused-vision, the place where *aim* lives in the body, the patron-chakra of the tracker who-sees-the-target-clearly.",
