      "What are my *Qianliyan and Shunfenger* \u2014 the thousand-mile-eye and the favorable-wind-ear that I have available for my most important work, and have I been using them (seeing further than the immediate horizon, hearing distress-signals before they are spoken) or have I been relying only on the information that reaches me through official-canonical channels?",
