      "Was my commercial-foundation a *Mercury-stolen-cattle-of-Apollo* theft \u2014 a poached customer, a borrowed idea, a stolen-technology with hidden-attribution \u2014 and have I driven-the-cattle-backwards-to-confuse-the-tracks rather than ritually-cleansed the foundation?",
