    the_shadow: "Anger. Criticism. Inflammation. Burnout-by-overdrive. When unbalanced, pitta becomes fire without water \u2014 irritability that flashes at small things, perfectionism that allows no rest, skin rashes, ulcers, headaches, the conviction that everyone else is doing it wrong. Ayurveda treats most inflammatory conditions (acid reflux, IBS-D, eczema, rosacea, chronic anger) as pitta imbalance.",
