    how_to_balance: "Cool + sweet + bitter + astringent + slow. Cool foods (cucumber, coconut, sweet juicy fruit, leafy greens). Avoid: spicy, fried, sour, fermented (no chili, no vinegar, no alcohol on flare-up days). Coconut oil rather than sesame for abhyanga. Moon-bathing \u2014 literally sitting under moonlight cools pitta the way sun cools nobody. Sheetali pranayama (cooling tongue-curl breath). Slow swims. Forest walks. Avoid noon-sun midday workouts. Spices: coriander, fennel, mint, rose, cardamom. Most important balancer: deliberate slowness when you most want to push.",
