    <p class="vibe">Ceres is asteroid 1 \u2014 Demeter, the harvest mother of the zodiac, the bowl. Where <a href="/gab44/eros">Eros</a> names arousal, <a href="/gab44/psyche">Psyche</a> names soul-recognition, <a href="/gab44/juno">Juno</a> names commitment, <a href="/gab44/vesta">Vesta</a> names sacred-fire devotion, and <a href="/gab44/pallas">Pallas</a> names elegant strategy, Ceres names the FEEDING \u2014 the specific shape of nurture each sign was given, and the loss-shaped grief that lives underneath the giving. Pick your sign.</p>

